{"overview":{"Symbol":"APC","Name":"ARKO Petroleum Corp.","Description":"ARKO Petroleum Corp. operates as a fuel distributor in North America. The company operates through three segments: Wholesale, Fleet Fueling, and GPMP. The Wholesale segment supplies fuel to gas stations operated by third-party dealers, sub-wholesalers, and bulk and spot purchasers. The Fleet Fueling segment engages in the operation of proprietary and third-party cardlock locations that sell fuel to light industrial trucks and commercial vehicles, and municipal entities. The GPMP segment sells and supplies fuel to ARKO retail sites. The company was incorporated in 2025 and is based in Richmond, Virginia. ARKO Petroleum Corp. is a subsidiary of Arko Convenience Stores LLC.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Energy","Industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","Address":"8565 Magellan Parkway, Richmond, VA, 23227-1150, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"1673285504","EBITDA":"145502000","PERatio":"26.664473","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"5.14","DividendPerShare":"2","DividendYield":"0.0999","EPS":"0.76","RevenuePerShareTTM":"152.721","ProfitMargin":"0.0064999997","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.01496","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"","RevenueTTM":"5578302976","GrossProfitTTM":"293399008","DilutedEPSTTM":"0.76","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"0.783","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"-0.002","AnalystTargetPrice":"22.4","TrailingPE":"26.664473","ForwardPE":"13.692567","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"0.29996318","PriceToBookRatio":"3.942607","EVToRevenue":"0.302","EVToEBITDA":"11.589","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"21.72","52WeekLow":"17","50DayMovingAverage":"19.2024","200DayMovingAverage":"18.943293","SharesOutstanding":"12570223","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"308.616"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"APC","3. Last Refreshed"